1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,079
Denmark's bill bans AI copies of your face,
unless it's satire. Who decides what's satire?

2
00:00:07,029 --> 00:00:12,507
The bill's answer: the courts, case by
case.

3
00:00:13,457 --> 00:00:18,936
Courts have ruled before. 1831, mocking the
king: guilty. 1988, a parody ad: protected.

4
00:00:19,886 --> 00:00:25,364
2024, AI fakes. A Berlin court: no. A
California court: yes.

5
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:31,943
Two all since 1831. Denmark's courts take
the decider.
